WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Align the gripper with the load knob.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Turn the knob - increase the load from 1 A to 2 A.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Current rises as the simulated stack voltage responds.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Separate session - remove the load before closing the valve.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Rotate the valve towards the closed position.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Confirm closure, then release the gripper.
